<title>south africa: GOLF-WILD COAST CHALLENGE FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WILD COAST CHALLENGE FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT EDWARD, South Africa 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final</p>
<p>round scores in the 750,000 rand ($163,000) Wild Coast Challenge</p>
<p>golf tournament at the par-70 Wild Coast Country Club on Sunday</p>
<p>(South African unless stated):</p>
<p>270 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 66 68 70 66</p>
<p>279 Justin Hobday 68 73 71 67</p>
<p>280 Ronnie McCann (U.S.) 70 76 68 66, James Kingston</p>
<p>71 68 70 71</p>
<p>281 Chris Williams 71 71 72 67</p>
<p>282 Warren Schutte 69 70 74 69, A.P. Botes 69 67 75 71,</p>
<p>Desvonde Botes 66 66 76 74</p>
<p>283 Tom Gillis (U.S.) 69 66 81 67, Ian Palmer 70 71 75 67,</p>
<p>Clinton Whitelaw 66 68 81 68, Marco Gortana 70 68 76 69,</p>
<p>Lan Gooch (U.S.) 69 74 72 68, Wayne Westner 70 70 73 70</p>
</text>
